<title>USA: U.S.OPTIONS FOCUS-Tambrands busy on takeover talk.</title>
<headline>U.S.OPTIONS FOCUS-Tambrands busy on takeover talk.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Call options on shares of Tambrands Inc were active for the third-straight session Tuesday as takeover rumors heated up, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;There's definitely a rumor of a takeover,&quot; an options trader at the New York Stock Exchange, where Tambrands options trade, said. &quot;Everyone in the retail world is buying.&quot;</p>
<p>The buying was squarely centered on the calls, led by the April 50s, which traded about 1,350 contracts. The option had open interest of 240 contracts, which included an addition of 110 on Monday.</p>
<p>The option was up 7/8 at 1-1/2.</p>
</text>
